The Improv Android port
========================

The Android application under `android/` (the Jetpack Compose UI, the
`ImprovMobileEngine` wiring, and the direct-ByteBuffer viewport reader) was
written by:

  David Gerbino <david.gerbino@dmgerbino.com>
  https://github.com/dmgerbino/improv-android

It drives the shared Rust engine through the `improv_android_ffi` UniFFI crate
in the Improv workspace.

Improv itself is by Greg Burd <greg@burd.me> and contributors; see the
repository root for the full project.
